# The keyboard standing in for a gamepad: XInput should report these as
# stick deflection and buttons. Nothing is aimed at a frame, because this
# guest presents nothing -- events with no frame arrive before it starts.
key down 87       # W  -> left stick up
key down 68       # D  -> left stick right
key down 38       # Up arrow -> right stick up
key down 32       # Space -> A
key down 13       # Enter -> Start
key down 90       # Z -> left trigger
